  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Loan TC Privatization  Infrastructure Concession</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Prstamo CT Privatizacin y Concesin Infraestructura</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THIS PROGRAM WOULD SUPPORT THE GOVERNMENT IN THE PROCESS OF PRIVATIZATION AND CONCESSION IN THE AREAS OF TRANSPORT, ENERGY, TELECOMMUNICATIONS AND SANITATION. THE PROGRAM WOULD SUPPORT THE CONSOLIDATION OF THE SECTORAL REGULATORY FRAMEWORKS, THE DESIGN AND EXECUTION OF CONCESSIONS AND OTHER MECHANISMS FOR PRIVATE SECTOR PARTICIPATION AT THE NATIONAL, DEPARTMENTAL AND MUNICIPAL LEVELS AS WELL AS THE PRE FEASIBILITY STUDIES TO BE USED IN THE PREPARATION OF THE RFPS.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
